    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I see. It sounds like you're saying the move toward national security and resilience is basically the only logical path forward now. But wouldn't that just lead to a bunch of massive inefficiencies and higher costs for everyone? Like, isn't there a huge risk that abandoning the \"market efficiency\" model just makes the whole world poorer in the long run?",
